content.text:
The evidence points to one root cause: a slow database call inside `ts-order-other-service`. Its effect reached the entry service through `ts-admin-order-service`, and the user-facing order-refresh path is also slow.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-order-other-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-order-other-service' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Order-other's own DB spans (SELECT ts.orders_other, SELECT other.entity.Order) have p95 of about 420-490 ms in the abnormal period, median about 0.3-0.7 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT floor(epoch(time)/60)*60 - (SELECT floor(epoch(min(time))/60)*60 FROM abnormal_traces) AS sec, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95 FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-order-other-service' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT ts.orders_other%' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "claim": "The slow DB-call p95 (about 414-465 ms) persists in every minute of the abnormal window, from its start."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind k, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-order-service' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT%' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "Order-service's DB spans stay fast in the abnormal period, so the slowness is specific to order-other's database calls.",
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-order-other-service",
      "to": "ts-admin-order-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name AS caller, c.service_name AS callee, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(c.duration,0.5)/1e6,1) callee_p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(p.duration,0.5)/1e6,1) caller_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.service_name <> p.service_name AND c.service_name IN ('ts-order-other-service','ts-admin-order-service','ts-security-service','ts-order-service') GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY n DESC",
          "claim": "Admin-order's client calls to order-other take about 215 ms at p50, matching order-other's slowed server time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-admin-order-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind k, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-order-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3 HAVING count(*)>20",
          "claim": "Admin-order's getAllOrders server span reaches p95 of about 1240 ms, inherited from its slow order-other calls, and is what the dashboard waits on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-order-other-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind k, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-order-other-service' AND span_name LIKE 'POST /api/v1/orderOtherService/orderOther/refresh%' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "The user-facing order-refresh endpoint on order-other slows to p95 of about 560 ms, the path the dashboard calls directly.",
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

